      <p>  <p>The string constant COMBAT_LOG_ID has the value &quot;45e0fcfa-2268-4490-a51c-3e51bdfe80d1&quot;</p>
  <p>Messages from the region to the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Combat_Log" target="_blank">combat log</a> will all be from this ID.</p>
  <p>Scripts may filter <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlListen" target="_blank">llListen</a> calls on this ID to receive only system generated combat log messages.</p>
</p>
